WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.459 --> 00:00:02.810
Let's go next to a Joey and Chicago.

00:00:02.810 --> 00:00:07.660
We haven't heard from Joey in Chicago since
may.

00:00:07.660 --> 00:00:08.660
Hey David.

00:00:08.660 --> 00:00:09.670
How's it going?

00:00:09.670 --> 00:00:10.670
Good.

00:00:10.670 --> 00:00:11.670
How are you?

00:00:11.670 --> 00:00:12.670
Good.

00:00:12.670 --> 00:00:14.820
Um, so I just want to get your thought.

00:00:14.820 --> 00:00:19.160
Do you think there's any chance that Donald
Trump would resign?

00:00:19.160 --> 00:00:25.570
Uh, I mean I've said before, I think if someone
sits him down and it's really getting bad

00:00:25.570 --> 00:00:30.859
and someone says you are going to be removed,
I think it's possible that he would, but I

00:00:30.859 --> 00:00:35.129
think that his ego would make them hold out
until the absolute last possible second.

00:00:35.129 --> 00:00:36.129
Yeah, for sure.

00:00:36.129 --> 00:00:37.730
That's what I was saying.

00:00:37.730 --> 00:00:41.929
Just cause you know, you see everything happening
and like how bad it is getting.

00:00:41.929 --> 00:00:46.230
And you know, I just watched one of your videos
about all the GOP people that are backing

00:00:46.230 --> 00:00:52.050
impeachment and it's like he's eventually
going to run out of Republicans, hopefully.

00:00:52.050 --> 00:00:57.679
Well remember the story I did was that there's
the idea that if the, if the impeachment vote,

00:00:57.679 --> 00:01:01.609
if the conviction vote were private, Republicans
might support it, but it's not private.

00:01:01.609 --> 00:01:05.560
So I don't actually think you're going to
see Republican support is removal.

00:01:05.560 --> 00:01:09.140
Yeah, for sure.

00:01:09.140 --> 00:01:10.140
All right.

00:01:10.140 --> 00:01:11.140
Well, yeah, that's, uh, that's it man.

00:01:11.140 --> 00:01:12.320
Thanks a lot for everything that you do.

00:01:12.320 --> 00:01:13.320
Okay.

00:01:13.320 --> 00:01:14.320
Joey in Chicago.

00:01:14.320 --> 00:01:14.325
Great to hear from you.

